// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// tufei1.c
inherit NPC;
void create()
{
    set_name("土匪", ({
 "tufei","bandit","fei" }) );
    set("gender", "男性");
    set("age", 30);
    set("long",
        "这家伙满脸横肉一付凶神恶煞的模样，令人望而生畏。\n");
    set("combat_exp", 10000);
        set("shen", -100);
    set("attitude", "aggressive");
    set("apply/attack", 20);
    set("apply/defense", 20);
    set("chat_chance", 30);
    set("chat_msg", ({
        "土匪一声大喊: 此山是我开，此树是我栽，若要从此过，留下买路财 !\n",
    }) );
    set_skill("unarmed", 40);
    set_skill("sword", 20);
    set_skill("parry", 40);
    set_skill("dodge", 40);
    setup();
        carry_object("/d/city/obj/duanjian")->wield();
        carry_object("/clone/misc/cloth")->wear();
    add_money("silver", 1);
}
